# Icon: The Icon Programming Language (Griswold & Griswold), 3rd edition; requirements/languages/icon.md
name     icon icn unicon
keyword  procedure end local static global record if then else while do until repeat every to by
keyword  return fail suspend break next case of default not initial link invocable
builtin  write writes read find upto many tab move map string integer
line-comment   #
string   " "  : escapes
string   ' '  : escapes
sigil    &    : builtin
operators  +-*/%=<>|!:~\?@^.
calls
